msgctxt "80"
msgid "Guah... Shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Kazuki, it's me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Kiryu-san? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Get Yuya and bring him over to the alleyway behind Public Park 3, fast. I've"
" got something to show you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I don't believe this shit. Didn't you say you were gonna stay out of it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "All I said was the decision is theirs to make, not mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Kiryu-san. What is it you wanted to show us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Eiji!? What the hell's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"He's been working with Kyogoku to cause friction between you and the other "
"hosts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I don't believe this... So that's why you joined Stardust? To mess "
"everything up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I might as well tell you now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "That whole thing about a \"second club\"? All bullshit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"The idea was to get all the hosts at Stardust to turn on each other, so "
"Kyogoku could start pulling them away to join his own network."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Then we'd step in to put things in order and take over the club itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"But man, I didn't think it'd be so easy! It was like dealing with a bunch of"
" idiots!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "I've heard enough from you! Where's Kyogoku!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "At our Millennium Tower office. You'll know it when you get there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Kazuki-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Dammit! Keeping Stardust trash-free is supposed to be my job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I got something to take care of first. Could you go after Kazuki-"
"san for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Gonna take out a little payback on Eiji, huh? Can't say I blame you. Okay, "
"leave Kazuki to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Thanks! I'll make sure this little tapeworm gets what he deserves, then I'll"
" get right to the Millennium Tower!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"What I deserve...? What's that supposed to mean? Are... Are you gonna hit me"
" again!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Get ready, 'cause Yuya's punches sting. Maybe even worse than mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Aiyeeeeeeeeeeee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "(That's Eiji... the guy who was with Yuya.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "(Where could he be going?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Yeah, everything's going great. Huh? Oh, for sure. Yuya's a major dumbass. "
"Uh-huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"I buttered him up like a turkey, telling him he'd be the perfect owner and "
"other stupid shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's going according to plan, too. All the hosts at Stardust are "
"pretty riled up. We oughta be able to take over soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Right... I'll call again if anything happens. Oh, and President Kyogoku... "
"Get the champagne ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "What the... Did you... Did you hear all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"Hear what? That Yuya's a \"dumbass\"? Or that your boss, Kyogoku, is up to "
"something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Damn you! Aaaagh, I can't let you fuck this up! There's way too much at "
"stake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Shoulda thought twice before eavesdropping... 'cause I'm about to make you "
"drop dead!"
msgstr ""

